<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .content {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #777;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .signature {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .agency {
            color: #555;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi <strong><%= firstName %></strong>,</p>

            <p>I hope you're doing well.</p>

            <p>I wanted to check your availability for potential opportunities within education. We are currently working with a number of schools seeking educators and support staff.</p>

            <p>If you are open to new roles, I would be happy to discuss options that match your experience and preferences.</p>

            <p>Please let me know:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your availability (start date)</li>
                <li>Preferred working pattern (full-time / part-time)</li>
                <li>Your location</li>
                <li>Roles you are interested in</li>
            </ul>

            <a href="mailto:kai.smith@edukai.co.uk" class="button">Reply to this email</a>
        </div>

        <div class="signature">
            Best regards,<br>
            Kai Smith<br>
            <span class="agency">Education Specialists Agency</span>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Education Specialists Agency<br>
            Email: <a href="mailto:kai.smith@edukai.co.uk">kai.smith@edukai.co.uk</a><br>
            <small>(This is a professional outreach regarding job opportunities)</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
